			"Message": "fix(comments): add missing periods and remove tautological sentence in ConfigurationError\n\nPass 1 + Pass 4 — Source/Error/ConfigurationError.rs\n\n- Replace tautological second sentence in //! module doc with an\n  informative one listing the four failure domains (key lookup,\n  value validation, parse failures, file I/O, circular-dependency)\n- Add missing sentence-final period to every /// doc comment:\n  - enum-level doc\n  - all 8 variant docs (KeyNotFound, InvalidValue, ValidationFailed,\n    ParseError, FileNotFound, FileReadError, FileWriteError,\n    CircularDependency)\n  - all 7 method docs (context, key_not_found, invalid_value,\n    validation_failed, parse_error, file_not_found, circular_dependency)",
